ext-pink-400 tracking-wider\">品番: KAVR00291</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <h4 class=\"text-lg md:text-2xl font-bold text-white leading-snug hover:text-pink-400 transition\">【VR】彼女も彼女の親友も超人気店のNO.1ピンサロ嬢！？ ピンサロ制服でハーレムフェラ～お店じゃ絶対NGの本サロ5P ＜おうちピンサロVR＞ 松本いちか、枢木あおい、佐野なつ、伊東める</h4>\n\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 items-start\">\n        <div class=\"md:col-span-5 space-y-3\">\n          <div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-950 shadow-inner group\">\n            <img src=\"https://pics.dmm.co.jp/digital/video/kavr00291/kavr00291pl.jpg\" alt=\"【VR】彼女も彼女の親友も超人気店のNO.1ピンサロ嬢！？ ピンサロ制服でハーレムフェラ～お店じゃ絶対NGの本サロ5P ＜おうちピンサロVR＞ 松本いちか、枢木あおい、佐野なつ、伊東める\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover transform group-hover:scale-105 transition duration-300\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"p-3 bg-slate-950/80 rounded-lg border border-slate-800 text-xs space-y-1 text-slate-400 font-mono\">\n            <div><strong class=\"text-slate-300 font-sans\">出演女優:</strong> 松本いちか / 枢木あおい / 佐野なつ / Nia（伊東める）</div>\n            <div><strong class=\"text-slate-300 font-sans\">メーカー:</strong> kawaii</div>\n            <div><strong class=\"text-slate-300 font-sans\">レーベル:</strong> kawaii* VR</div>\n            <div><strong class=\"text-slate-300 font-sans\">参考価格:</strong> 150~</div>\n          </div>\n          <a href=\"https://al.fanza.co.jp/?lurl=https%3A%2F%2Fvideo.dmm.co.jp%2Fav%2Fcontent%2F%3Fid%3Dkavr00291&af_id=onchan555-003&ch=api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"block w-full text-center py-3 px-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-pink-600 to-rose-600 hover:from-pink-500 hover:to-rose-500 text-white font-bold rounded-xl shadow-lg transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition duration-150\">\n            FANZA公式で作品詳細・本編を見る ➔\n          </a>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"md:col-span-7 space-y-4 text-slate-300 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base\">\n          <div class=\"p-4 bg-slate-950/50 rounde